msgid ""
"This configuration extends the A2 1P1D deployment in [Section 5.2](#52-1p1d-pd-disaggregated-deployment) with a\n"
"Mooncake KV Cache Pool. `MooncakeHybridConnector` continues to transfer KV\n"
"cache from Prefill to Decode, while `AscendStoreConnector` stores reusable KV\n"
"cache in Mooncake. Both connectors are configured as children of\n"
"`MultiConnector`."
msgstr ""
"此配置在[第 5.2 节](#52-1p1d-pd-disaggregated-deployment)的 A2 1P1D 部署基础上扩展了一个\n"
"Mooncake KV Cache Pool。`MooncakeHybridConnector` 继续将 KV\n"
"缓存从 Prefill 传输到 Decode，而 `AscendStoreConnector` 将可复用的 KV\n"
"缓存存储到 Mooncake 中。两个连接器均配置为\n"
"`MultiConnector` 的子连接器。"

msgid ""
"Start the components in this order: Mooncake Master Service, Decode engines, Prefill engines, and then the PD proxy. The Mooncake Store clients are embedded in the vLLM processes; no standalone Store process is required for this configuration.\n"
"Wait until the Mooncake master process reports successful initialization before starting the Decode engines and the Prefill engines. After every Prefill engine and every Decode engine is ready, start the proxy with the same endpoint mapping described in [Section 5.2.2.4](#5224-deploy-the-pd-proxy)."
msgstr ""
"请按以下顺序启动各组件：Mooncake Master 服务、Decode 引擎、Prefill 引擎，最后是 PD 代理。Mooncake Store 客户端已内嵌在 vLLM 进程中；此配置无需独立的 Store 进程。\n"
"请等待 Mooncake master 进程报告初始化成功后再启动 Decode 引擎和 Prefill 引擎。在所有 Prefill 引擎和所有 Decode 引擎就绪后，使用[第 5.2.2.4 节](#5224-deploy-the-pd-proxy)中所述的相同端点映射启动代理。"

msgid ""
"For Mooncake configuration, and troubleshooting, refer to the [KV Cache Pool"
" "
"guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-1-mooncake-"
"backend)."
msgstr ""
"有关 Mooncake 配置和故障排除，请参阅 [KV Cache Pool "
"指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-1-mooncake-"
"backend)。"

msgid ""
