"    `1` on the corresponding node. Set `NODE0_IP` to the IP address of Node 0 and\n"
"    set `LOCAL_IP`, `NIC_NAME`, and `MODEL_PATH` for each node."
msgstr ""
"在两台 A2 服务器上运行此脚本。在对应节点上将 `NODE_RANK` 设置为 `0` 或\n"
"    `1`。将 `NODE0_IP` 设置为节点 0 的 IP 地址，并\n"
"    为每个节点设置 `LOCAL_IP`、`NIC_NAME` 和 `MODEL_PATH`。"

msgid ""
"Omit `--data-parallel-start-rank` on Node 0. Start Node 0 first, then start "
"Node 1. Only Node 0 exposes the API endpoint. Each server contributes one "
"TP8 rank to the global DP2 topology."
msgstr ""
"在节点 0 上省略 `--data-parallel-start-rank`。先启动节点 0，再启动节点 1。仅节点 0 对外暴露 API "
"端点。每台服务器为全局 DP2 拓扑贡献一个 TP8 rank。"

